     "explanation": "The RHIT is awarded by AHIMA through its certifying body, CCHIIM (Commission on Certification for Health Informatics and Information Management). A core eligibility requirement is graduating from a CAHIIM-accredited HIM associate degree program — which your capstone helps you complete. The Joint Commission accredits facilities, the OIG oversees compliance, and CMS runs Medicare; none of them credential RHITs.",
