     "explanation": "The RHIT must be maintained through continuing education. AHIMA requires RHITs to earn and report a set number of CEUs within each two-year recertification cycle, keeping your knowledge current as coding, regulations, and technology evolve. The credential is not permanent-without-effort, does not require retaking the full exam yearly, and is not tied to a personal facility survey.",
